<title>EGYPT: EGYPT'S CIB SIX-MONTH RESULTS.</title>
<headline>EGYPT'S CIB SIX-MONTH RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial International Bank (CIB) results for the first half of the 1997 calendar year, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds with comparative figures from previous year):</p>
<p>				   30JUNE97	     30JUNE96</p>
<p>Total deposits	  9,221,607,930	6,131,587,179</p>
<p>Total assets	   13,980,213,960	9,400,128,334</p>
<p>Reserves		    580,405,450	  417,304,053</p>
<p>Provisions		  271,440,403	  286,106,217</p>
<p>Shareholders funds     1,080,405,450	 963,144,771</p>
<p>Net profits		  133,768,132	 122,365,876</p>
<p>Full name is Commercial International Bank</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
